{"engine": "paddleocr_vl", "status": "ok", "format": "markdown", "text": "## Agent 기반 지식 추출 및 통합 검색 품질\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_163_251_699_823.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"26%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 온돌로지 지식 추출 정확도\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_chart_box_746_347_1065_743.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"15%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 임베딩 모델 한/영 검색 정확도\n\n개체식별, 관계추출 등의 특화 학습을 통해 온톨로지 지식 추출 정확도 향상\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_chart_box_1113_352_1434_740.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"16%\" /></div>\n\n\n한/영 Cross-lingual 특화 데이터를 활용하여 검색 정확도 확보\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">전문 도메인 리랭킹 정확도</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_chart_box_1514_340_1817_738.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"15%\" /></div>\n\n\nHard-negative 샘플이 많은\n\n전문 도메인에서도 우수한 리랭킹 성능\n\n\n<table border=1 style='margin: auto; word-wrap: break-word;'><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>Rank</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>Model</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>F1%</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>Paper</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>Code</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>Result</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>Year</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>1</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>Exobrain</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>Improving Sentence-Level Rotation Extraction through Curriculum Learning</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>☑</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>2021</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>2</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>RoBERTa-large-typed-marker</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>91.3</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>An Improved Baseline for Sentence-level Rotation Extraction</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>☑</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>2021</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>3</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>SpanBERT</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>85.3</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>SpanBERT: Improving Pre-training by Representing and Predicting Spans</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>☑</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>2021</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>4</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>C-GCN</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>80.3</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>Graph Convolution over Phruned Dependency Trees Improves Rotation Extraction</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>☑</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>2019</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>5</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>PA-LSTM</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>79.4</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>Position-aware Attention and Supervised Data Improve Slot Fitting</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>☑</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>2017</td></tr></table>\